              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14.10-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“In yam ineno atwom ma kwarowa gubedo kwede i Ejipt, dok bene iwinyo kokogi ki i dog Nam Makwar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Nia 7.8–12.32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in itiyo bene lanyut ki taŋo me aura i kom Parao ki luticce ducu, ki i kom jo ducu ma i lobone, pien in onoŋo iŋeyo kit ma gubedo kwede ka uno kwarowa; ma omiyo in ilimo iye yweka, macalo tye kwede nio wa onyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.21+EXO.14.22+EXO.14.23+EXO.14.24+EXO.14.25+EXO.14.26+EXO.14.27+EXO.14.28+EXO.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 14.21-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.15.4+EXO.15.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15.4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In yam ipoko i dye nam pi lwakki, ka itelogi imiyo gukato ki iye i wi ŋom mutwo. Dok ibolo merok ma gulubo korgi woko i pii, imiyo gumwony ci gulwiny woko i kut matut, macalo gweŋ ma lwiny piny i i pii mager. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.21+EXO.13.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 13.21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In yam itelo nyimgi i dyeceŋ ki pol mucuŋ macalo wir, ka dok itelo wigi i dyewor ki mac mucuŋ macalo wir me menyo botgi yo ka ma myero guwot gucit iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Nia 19.18–23.33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In ilor ibino piny i kom got Cinai, ci iloko ki lwakki ki kunnu ki i polo; ka imiyo botgi cik maber ki pwony ma myero gin gulubi kacel ki gin ma iciko ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In ipwonyogi ni gugwok cabitti obed maleŋ, ka dok imiyogi cik kacel ki gin ma in iciko ni gugwoki, kun wok ki bot laticci Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
