          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.1+EXO.32.2+EXO.32.3+EXO.32.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 32.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bed yam gucweyo cal wod twon dyaŋ ma giliyo aliya, kun giwacci, ‘Man aye Lubaŋawa mukwanyowa woko ki i Ejipt,’ gin ma gutiyo gutiyo me yeto in, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.8.2+DEU.8.3+DEU.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 8.2-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento in pe ibwotogi ata Him pi kicani; ki pol mucuŋ macalo wir ma obedo ka telo wigi iyo-ni, onoŋo pe orwenyo woko ki botgi i dyeceŋ, kadi mac mucuŋ macalo wir ma obedo ka menyo botgi yo ma giwoto iye i dyewor bene pe orwenyo woko ki botgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In imiyo Cwiny meri maber me pwonyogi, dok pe iweko pitogi ki manna, imiyogi bene gumato pii me kweyo orwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In yam igwokogi maber i tim pi mwaka pyeraŋwen, kun imiyo botgi gin ducu ma gin mito, dok boŋŋigi yam pe guti guyec woko ducu, ki tyengi bene yam pe okwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In imiyo gulwenyo ci guloyo lwak rok mapol, ipoko botgi lobo ma cok ki wan apokki lobogi, kun gumayo lobo pa Cikon kabaka me Kecibon kacel ki lobo pa Og kabaka me Bacan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
