                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kombeddi, ai Lubaŋawa madit, ma won twero, dok in Lubaŋa ma gilworo, pien igwoko gicikkeni ki mar meri ma pe lokke, can mapek twatwal-li pe iwek obed gin matidi mo ki tuŋ boti, can meno opoto i komwa, ki i kom lukerwa, ki i kom rwodiwa, ki i kom ajwagiwa, ki i kom lunebiwa, ki i kom kwarowa, ki i kom lwakki ducu, nia wa i kare pa luker me Aciria nio kwede wa onyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento in itimo gin ma tye atir pi pwodowa kit meno; in ibedo ka tic kwedwa ki ada, ento wan aye ma watyeko timo bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lukerwa, rwodiwa, kacel ki ajwagiwa, ki kwarowa ducu yam pe gugwoko cikki, dok, pe gulubo gin ma iciko kadi wa jukki ducu ma onoŋo ijukogi kwede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luker guloyo lwakki pi gum madit ma imiyo botgi, i kare ma gubedo ka malac i ŋom maber ma ceko cam ma imiyo botgi, ento gin pe gulokke, pe guweko timgi marac wek guti gin ma imito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, kombeddi wan doŋ wadoko opii i lobo ma yam imiyowa ni wacam gin ma ocek i potone ki yomcwiny, kacel ki jami ducu mabeco ma nonne iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lonyo me lobo ducu wamiyo bot luker ma in iketogi me loyowa pi balwa; gin gitye ki tek me loyo komwa ki Umwa makwo ducu, kit ma gimito, omiyo wan kombeddi watye ki atwom madwoŋ.”",
